# Findings reviewed and accepted for this project (read by "trivy fs" from the repo root).
# Remove a line to make Trivy report that finding again.

# Deployer EC2 needs open egress: GitHub, Docker Hub, Helm, kubectl, Jenkins and ECR downloads
AWS-0104

# The public subnets host the deployer EC2 and the NAT gateway, which need public IPs
AWS-0164

# S3 buckets use SSE-S3 (AES256); a customer-managed KMS key is not needed here
AWS-0132

# EKS secrets encryption cannot be turned off once enabled: enable it as a separate change
AWS-0039

# deploy.tf can re-push the same tf-<hash> tag, which immutable ECR tags would reject
AWS-0031
